{"ID":"20240506082114-yp9ruvj","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506082114-yp9ruvj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506082114-yp9ruvj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627081008-rr5hngf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612130632-87gwi86\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612131019-lk626gx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"234蟹","type":"doc","updated":"20240821160413"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240627081008-rr5hngf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627081008-rr5hngf","updated":"20240627081008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 558px;","style":"width: 548px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"螃蟹2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/螃蟹2-20240627081008-ix7sl1m.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 548px;\" parent-style=\"width: 558px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 595px;","style":"width: 585px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"螃蟹3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/螃蟹3-20240627081050-eirado5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 585px;\" parent-style=\"width: 595px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627081328-t63d4k4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627081328-t63d4k4","updated":"20240627081328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 533px;","style":"width: 523px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"螃蟹4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/螃蟹4-20240627081328-z2njrro.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 523px;\" parent-style=\"width: 533px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 700px;","style":"width: 690px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"螃蟹5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/螃蟹5-20240627081419-hky7pc7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 690px;\" parent-style=\"width: 700px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821160318-ic1grlw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821160318-ic1grlw","updated":"20240821160413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 562px;","style":"width: 552px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蟹"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蟹-20240821160318-46xw6gh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 552px;\" parent-style=\"width: 562px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 615px;","style":"width: 605px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蟹 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蟹 1-20240821160413-b8cdt2r.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 605px;\" parent-style=\"width: 615px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612130628-3epi4q4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130628-3epi4q4"}},{"ID":"20240612130819-i6wo0ia","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130819-i6wo0ia","updated":"20240612130825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蟹《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130819-cmmvw7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130819-cmmvw7s","updated":"20240612130819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130819-c8q8rpq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130819-c8q8rpq","updated":"20240627080832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主脑中邪气，热结痛，歪"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"僻面肿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"败漆。烧之致鼠。生池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130819-pdkza10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130819-pdkza10","updated":"20240612130819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生伊洛诸水中，取无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130819-1cc7ev8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130819-1cc7ev8","updated":"20240612130819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：蟹有二敖八足旁行，非蛇鳝之穴无所庇，或作，蛫蟹也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130819-d78i2ei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130819-d78i2ei","updated":"20240612130819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《荀子》勤学扁云：蟹六跪而二螯，非蛇蟺之穴无所寄托。《广雅》云：蜅蟹，蛫也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130819-cnke4tf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130819-cnke4tf","updated":"20240612130819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《尔雅》云：螖蛫，小者。郭璞云：或曰即蟚螖也，似蟹而小。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130921-1k5kd3n","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130921-1k5kd3n"}},{"ID":"20240612130923-4q0kvgz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130923-4q0kvgz","updated":"20240612130927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蟹《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130923-szp2lmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130923-szp2lmk","updated":"20240612130923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有毒．解结散血，愈漆疮，养筋益气．爪，主破胞，堕胎．生伊芳洛诸水中，取无时．（莨菪毒．）"}]},{"ID":"20240612130923-0hohhbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130923-0hohhbl","updated":"20240627080823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶蟹，味咸，寒．主胸中邪气，热结痛， 歪"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"僻面肿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，败漆，烧之致鼠．生池泽．"}]},{"ID":"20240612131003-fr7gpli","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131003-fr7gpli"}},{"ID":"20240612131004-spuk9ck","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131004-spuk9ck","updated":"20240612131013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蟹《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131004-mzpykz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131004-mzpykz4","updated":"20240612131004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通经络．散瘀血．续筋骨．解漆疮．有横走之功．具咸寒之性．动风发毒．解热行胎．（蟹咸寒有小毒．能横行经络．解散瘀血．治折伤．续筋骨．内服外敷．皆有神效．善解漆疮．其黄能化漆为水．亦物之相制也．极能动风发毒．风家疮家不可食之．此物为供食之品．凡见异形怪状者．均有大毒．不可食．又不可与柿同食．有暴亡之虑．蟹爪又能堕胎孕妇忌服．）"}]},{"ID":"20240612131018-vgef11k","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131018-vgef11k"}},{"ID":"20240612131019-lk626gx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131019-lk626gx","updated":"20240612131030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蟹《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131019-kajatrh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131019-kajatrh","updated":"20240627080820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，寒，有毒。主胸中邪气，热结痛， 歪"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"僻面肿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，败漆烧之致鼠。解结散血，愈漆疮，养筋益气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131019-sjbtwkf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131019-sjbtwkf","updated":"20240612131019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"爪"}]},{"ID":"20240612131019-cyrd1xv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131019-cyrd1xv","updated":"20240612131019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主破胞堕胎，生伊芳洛池泽诸水中，取无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130949-kxcbkc6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130949-kxcbkc6"}},{"ID":"20240612130951-w66wz46","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130951-w66wz46","updated":"20240612130956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蟹《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130951-48efe59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130951-48efe59","updated":"20240612130951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泻，散血"}]},{"ID":"20240612130951-23fby9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130951-23fby9m","updated":"20240612130951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸寒。除热解结，散血通经，续筋骨（筋绝伤者，取蟹黄、足髓，熬纳疮中，筋即续生。骨节脱离者，生捣，热酒调服，渣涂半日，骨内谷谷有声即好），涂漆疮（能败漆）。然寒胃动风。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130951-pawgqkl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130951-pawgqkl","updated":"20240612130951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蟹爪堕胎（产难及子死腹中者，服蟹爪汤即出。其螯烧烟，能集鼠于庭。中蟹毒者，捣藕节，热酒调服。腌蟹，中入蒜则不沙）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130931-bm8c58p","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130931-bm8c58p"}},{"ID":"20240612130912-jz63749","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130912-jz63749","updated":"20240612130916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蟹《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130912-choro54","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130912-choro54","updated":"20240612130912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸寒小毒。未被霜者有毒。多食腹痛泄泻，生姜、紫苏、豉汁、芦根汁并可解之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130912-ihmtwd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130912-ihmtwd6","updated":"20240612130912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其性喜入蛇穴，得其毒则骤长，故重一斤以上者误食杀人。又两目相向、足斑目赤者大毒，不可食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130912-13u0iuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130912-13u0iuv","updated":"20240627080826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主胸中邪气热结痛， 歪"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"僻面肿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，能败漆，烧之致鼠。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130912-3ezf3j7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130912-3ezf3j7","updated":"20240627080828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蟹之外骨内肉，生青熟赤，阴包阳象无疑。性专破血，故能续断绝筋骨。《本经》主胸中邪气热结痛， 歪"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"僻面肿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，皆是瘀血为患。性能败漆，今人生捣治漆疮，涂火烫，皆取散血之意。《日华》治筋骨折伤，生捣罨之。藏器云，能续断筋，去壳用黄，捣烂微炒纳入疮中，筋即连也，可知其功不独散而能和血矣。凡物之赤者皆热，惟蟹与柿性寒，所以二物不宜同食，令人泄泻发症瘕。妊娠忌食，以其性专逆水横行也。其爪为催生下死胎胞衣专药。《千金》神造汤，治子死腹中并双胎一死一生，服之令死者出，生者安，神验方也。但以一边运动一边沉着者即是无疑，方用蟹爪一升，甘草一尺，东流水一斗，以苇薪煮至二升，去滓，入真阿胶二两，令烊，顿服或分二服。若人困不能服，灌入即活。取蟹之散血，而爪触之即脱也，然必生脱者连足用之。《丹方》治蓄血发黄胸胁结痛而不浮肿者，蟹壳 存性黑糖调，无灰酒下三钱，不过数服效。若浮肿者为气病，无藉于蟹之散血也。妇人乳痈硬肿，蟹壳灰一服即散。又以涂朱烧烟辟臭虫，熏之即毙，则杀虫之功从可知矣。蟹之相类多种，如蝤蛑拥剑不常见外，其蟛蜞、蟛 春时甚多。蟛蜞螯光无毒可醯而食。蟛 螯毛有毒，误食令人吐下。又有一种生沙穴中，见人则避者，沙狗也。时珍虽言不可食，今海错中用之，非蟛蜞之可比也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130859-bjrwyp3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130859-bjrwyp3"}},{"ID":"20240612130900-ff3fp6b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130900-ff3fp6b","updated":"20240612130904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蟹《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130900-2jcbq2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130900-2jcbq2g","updated":"20240612130900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味咸寒，有小毒。主治胸中邪气热结痛， 辟面肿，能败漆，烧之致鼠。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130900-7csqcp7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130900-7csqcp7","updated":"20240612130900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（蟹，山东、淮阳、江浙、闽广近海诸处及水乡多有之。有螃蟹、郭索、横行、介士、无肠、公子诸名。雄者脐长，雌者脐圆，腹中之黄，应月盈亏，其性多躁，引声 沫，至死乃已霜降前食物，故有毒，霜降后可食。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612130900-zg43pnz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130900-zg43pnz","updated":"20240612130900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今人以蟹为肴馔，未尝以之治病，唯面有漆疮，多用蟹黄敷之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130847-a8go4q5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130847-a8go4q5"}},{"ID":"20240612130831-t8lxijb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130831-t8lxijb","updated":"20240612130837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蟹《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130831-jk6jrkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130831-jk6jrkc","updated":"20240612130831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蟹主胸中邪热结，爪能堕胎破瘀血，壳黄化漆更续筋，消食涂疮同脚节。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130831-dhov1b6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130831-dhov1b6","updated":"20240612130831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"足节屈曲，行则旁横，每至夏末秋初则解壳，故曰螃蟹。味咸，寒，有毒。主胸中邪热，解结散血，养筋益气，理经脉，利关节，去五脏中烦闷，消食，乃食品中之佳味，最宜人。须是八月一日蟹吃稻芒后方可食，霜后更佳，以前食之有毒，十二月食之伤神。体有风疾人并孕妇不可食。独螯独目，四足六足，两目相向者，皆有大毒，不可食。误中者，惟藕蒜汁、冬瓜汁，紫苏、黑豆豉汁可解之。爪，主堕胞胎，破宿血，止产后血闷腹痛，酒及醋汤煎服。壳中黄及脚中髓，熬为末，纳金疮中，能续断绝筋骨，其黄能化漆为水，故敷漆疮及久疽疮疥。其延骨焙干，和白蔹等分为末，乳汁调涂小儿头缝不合。其螯和犬血烧烟，可以集鼠于庭。大抵蟹类甚多，壳阔多黄者名川，其螯最锐，食之行风气；扁而大者名蝤蛑，解热气及小儿痞气；其最小者名蟛蜞，食之令人吐利；一螯大一螯小者名拥剑，可供食。余蟹有毒，皆不可食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130748-ehxnz6o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130748-ehxnz6o"}},{"ID":"20240612130809-a0e1py1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130809-a0e1py1","updated":"20240612130815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蟹《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130809-eaayuhf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130809-eaayuhf","updated":"20240612130809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」螃蟹、郭索、横行介士、无肠公子。雌名：博带。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130809-3cwxs80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130809-3cwxs80","updated":"20240612130809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」咸、寒、有小毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130809-oaxjn87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130809-oaxjn87","updated":"20240612130809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」杀莨菪毒，解鳝鱼毒、漆毒，治疟及黄疸，捣成膏兴疥疮、癣疮。捣出汁滴耳聋。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130628-yxpjo25","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130628-yxpjo25"}},{"ID":"20240626200058-5f97899","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240626200058-5f97899","updated":"20240626200058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"螃蟹《本草新编》"}]},{"ID":"20240626200058-xtt52j0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626200058-xtt52j0","updated":"20240626200058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"螃蟹，味咸，气寒，有毒。散血解瘀，益气养筋。除胸热烦闷，去面肿 僻，愈漆疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240626200058-8b51lw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626200058-8b51lw5","updated":"20240626200058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"续筋骨。夙疾人食之，其病复发。怀孕妇食下，令人横生。此物最不利人，而人最喜噬。然得此以解散胸热，亦有可取。若入药，则只用之于跌损之内也。"}]},{"ID":"20240626200058-k6il0cv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626200058-k6il0cv","updated":"20240626200058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问蟹爪主破胞堕胎，岂以其爪性过利乎？曰∶蟹性最动，而爪尤动之至者。子死腹中，胞不能破，用之实神，正取其动也。（〔批〕人胞直生，而蟹爪旁走，故取而破胞耳，又不可不知。）"}]},{"ID":"20240626200058-jqcaqw6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240626200058-jqcaqw6","updated":"20240626200058"}},{"ID":"20240626200055-jv21tfz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240626200055-jv21tfz"}},{"ID":"20240612130729-luz6yq8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130729-luz6yq8","updated":"20240612130738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蟹《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130729-7s7oder","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130729-7s7oder","updated":"20240612130729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，寒，有毒。主胸中邪气热结痛， 僻，面肿，败漆烧之致鼠，解结散血，愈漆疮，养筋益气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130729-ke14k4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130729-ke14k4u","updated":"20240612130729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"爪"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主破胞，堕胎。生伊芳、洛池泽诸水中。取无时。（杀莨菪毒、漆毒。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612130729-kbswoht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130729-kbswoht","updated":"20240612130729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶蟹类甚多，蝤（音遒） （音谋）、拥剑、彭 （音越）皆是，并不入药。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130729-ki4hzad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130729-ki4hzad","updated":"20240612130729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唯蟹最多有用，仙方∶以化漆为水，服之长生。以黑犬血灌之三日，烧之，诸鼠毕至。未被霜甚有毒，云食水莨（音建）所为，人中之，不即疗多死。目相向者亦杀人，服冬瓜汁、紫苏汁及大黄丸皆剑，似彭 而大，似蟹而小，不可食。蔡谟初渡江，不识而啖之，几死，叹曰∶读《尔雅》不熟，为劝学人所误。今按陈藏器本草云∶蟹脚中髓及脑并壳中黄芒，长寸许，向东输海神，开腹中犹有海水。《本经》云∶伊芳、洛水中者石蟹，形段不同。其黄敷久疽疮，无不瘥者。臣禹锡等谨按陈藏器云∶蝤 ，主小作闪痞，煮食之。大者长尺余，两螯至强，八月能与虎斗，虎不如也。随大潮退壳，一退一长。拥剑，一名桀步。一螯极小，以大者斗。小者食，别无功。彭蜞有小毒，膏主湿癣疽疮，不瘥者涂之。食其肉，能令人吐下至困。蔡谟渡江，误食者。彭 如小蟹，无毛，海人食之，别无功。孟诜云∶蟹，主散诸热。治胃气，理经脉，消食。八月输芒后食好，未输时为长未成。就醋食之，利肢节，去五脏中烦闷气。其物虽形状恶，食甚宜人。日华子云∶螃蟹，凉，微毒。治产后肚痛，血不下，并酒服。筋骨折伤，生捣，炒 ，良。脚爪，破宿血，止产后血闭、肚痛，酒及醋汤煎服，良。又云∶蝤蛑，冷，无毒。解热气，治小儿痞气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130729-cmnkovh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130729-cmnkovh","updated":"20240612130729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶蟹，生伊芳、洛池泽诸水中，今淮海、京东、河北陂泽中多有之，伊芳、洛乃反难得也。八足二螯，大者箱角两出，足节屈曲，行则旁横。今人以为食品之佳味，独熬独目及两目相向者，皆有大毒，不可食。其黄能化漆为水，故涂漆疮用之。黄并肉熬末，以纳金疮中，筋断亦可续。黄并螯烧烟，可以集鼠于庭。爪入药最多。胡洽疗孕妇僵仆，胎转上抢心困笃，有蟹爪汤之类是也。《经》云∶取无时。俗传蟹八月一日，取稻芒两枚，长一、二寸许，东行输送其长，故今南方∶捕得蟹，瘥早则有衔稻芒者，此后方∶可食之。以前时长未成就，其食之，急以豉汁可解。阔壳而多黄者名 ，生南海中，其螯最锐，断物如芟刈焉，食之行风气。扁而最大，后足阔者，为蝤蛑，岭南人谓之拨棹子，以后脚形如棹也。一名 。随潮退过，一退一长。其大者如升，小者如盏盘。两螯无毛，所在异于蟹。其力至强，能与虎斗，往往虎不能胜。主小儿闪癖，煮与食之良。一螯大，一螯小者，名拥剑，又名桀步。常以大螯斗，小螯食物。一名执火，以其螯赤故也。其最小者名彭 （音滑），吴人语讹为彭越。《尔雅》云∶ （音泽），小者 （力刀切）。郭璞云∶即彭 也，似蟹而小，其膏可以涂癣，食之令人吐下至困。彭蜞亦其类也，蔡谟渡江误食者，是此也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130729-0oj04rw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130729-0oj04rw","updated":"20240612130729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"食疗云∶蟹，足斑、目赤不可食，杀人。又，堪治胃气，消食。又，八月前，每个蟹腹内有稻谷一颗，用输海神。待输芒后，过八月方∶食即好。经霜更美，未经霜时有毒。又，盐淹之作KT ，有气味。和酢食之，利肢节，去五脏中烦闷气。其物虽恶形容，食之甚益人。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130729-n6utw4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130729-n6utw4f","updated":"20240612130729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"爪，能安杵蟹敷之亦效。又方∶金疮方，续筋多取蟹黄及脑并足中肉熬末孙真人十二月勿食蟹，伤神。简要济众小儿解颅不合。生蟹足骨半两，焙干，白蔹半两，为末。用乳汁和，贴骨缝上，以瘥为度。杨氏产乳∶妊娠人不得食螃蟹，令儿横生也。荀卿云蟹，六跪而二螯，非蛇、鳝之穴，无所寄托。凡食鳝毒，可食蟹解之，鳝畏蟹。蟹，鳝类也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130729-s4yw7a5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130729-s4yw7a5","updated":"20240612130729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"类聚相解其效速于他耳。沈存中笔谈关中无螃蟹，土人恶其形状，以为怪物。秦州人家，收得一干蟹，有病疟者，则借去悬门上，往往遂瘥。不但人不识，鬼亦不识。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130729-8n2csfc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130729-8n2csfc","updated":"20240612130729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶蟹，伊芳、洛绝少，今多自京师来，京师亦自河北置之。今河北沿边沧、瀛州等处所出甚多，徐州亦有，但不及河北者。小儿解颅，以螯并白芨烂捣，涂囟上，颅合。此物极动风，体有风疾人，不可食，屡见其事。河北人取之，当八、九月蟹浪之时，直于塘泺岸上，伺此物每至夏末秋初，则如蝉蜕解。当日名蟹之意，必取此义。"}]},{"ID":"20240626200039-1e1h0hy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240626200039-1e1h0hy"}},{"ID":"20240626200040-en7uv9q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240626200040-en7uv9q","updated":"20240626200040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"螃蟹《本草蒙筌》"}]},{"ID":"20240626200040-fss6ogn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626200040-fss6ogn","updated":"20240626200040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，气寒。一云气平。有毒。生陂泽中穴于沮洳，遇八九月出食稻芒。（秋深稻熟之时，尽出于田内，各持一穗以朝其魁，然后从其所之至长江而奔，自江转海，其形益大，或谓持稻以输海神也。）行旁行，有八跪二螫八足；壳黄褐，现十二星点微红。（如鲤之三十六鳞，大小相类。）腹虚实应月盛衰，种雌雄在脐大小。（雌者脐圆而大，雄者脐尖而小。）"}]},{"ID":"20240626200040-26kl27p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626200040-26kl27p","updated":"20240626200040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"渔人捕取，霜后益佳。（未经霜取者有毒，不可食。）酒糟醉死藏留，馔品亦为珍味。（凡取食忌见灯火，犯则发烧易坏。）散血解结，益气养筋。除胸热闷烦，去面肿 僻。愈漆疮化漆成水，（仙方以化漆水服之长生。）续筋骨使筋即连。（足中、髓壳中黄并脑碎之，微熬纳筋断处即连。）风疾人食之，其病复发；怀孕妇食下，令子横生。炉内烧烟，可集群鼠。"}]},{"ID":"20240626200040-gf8fxor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626200040-gf8fxor","updated":"20240626200040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"形状异者，有毒中藏。（其足斑、目赤、独螯、独目、或两目相向、腹下有毛、腹中有骨、六足四足者，并有大毒，不可食。）傥误入喉，未免被害。豉蒜冬瓜黑豆，煎汁并可解除。"}]},{"ID":"20240626200040-k8gh8r5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626200040-k8gh8r5","updated":"20240626200040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"爪"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主破胞堕胎，亦通产后血闭。余种主治，各有所长。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蟹"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"壳阔多黄，两螯最锐，行大人风气亦宜。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蝤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（音由）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蛑"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（音谋）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蟹"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"壳扁极大，两螯无毛，去小儿痞气堪用。"}]},{"ID":"20240626200040-inw46tt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626200040-inw46tt","updated":"20240626200040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蟛蜞蟹略小"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，食多吐利损人。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蟛 （音越）蟹"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"至微，膏涂湿癣杀毒。（不宜食。）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"拥剑蟹"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"者，大小两螯。"}]},{"ID":"20240626200040-2a6n41l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626200040-2a6n41l","updated":"20240626200040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大螯待斗常伸，小螯供食每缩，亦有毒，并不宜食之。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"虾"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，气平。小毒。河涧俱生，善游好跃，其字从假，盖以水母假之而动也。活则色绿，煮熟鲜红。为馔不宜多食，发疮动风甚验。小儿及鸡犬勿食，误犯则脚屈难行。捣生者如泥，敷赤白游肿。口疳齿 ，过宿尽消。又种无须，腹下通黑。煮之色白，并有毒藏。急弃沟渠，庶免害及。虾 乃热饭拌造，同食忌鸡肉须知。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大红虾"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出自海中，身肥大须长丈许。（史说晋滕条不信，其后有至东海者，取须长四尺四寸封而寄之。）土人捕获，烈日曝干。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"壳"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"浓用作酒杯，须劲截为策杖。非得善价，不轻贸人。主治忌宜，同前弗异。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"海马"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"种亦虾属，二三寸长；雌雄相对不离，色则黄褐。"}]},{"ID":"20240626200040-3kv8mi4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626200040-3kv8mi4","updated":"20240626200040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首类马仍系虾身，背有纹仿佛竹节。布网水面，每每得之。下胎易来，果难产圣药；（临产时带于身傍，或烧末酒服并效。）兴阳不痿，诚取乐春方。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蜡"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（音搓。又作 ，一名水母。樗蒲鱼。"}]},{"ID":"20240626200040-b4mhndi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626200040-b4mhndi","updated":"20240626200040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）形如白沫 ，东海多生，大小不等；无腹而头眼藏闭，倚虾为目，游水如飞。虾见人勿惊， 随则沉没。故曰∶虾动 沉。又曰∶水母目虾是也。调味作馔，姜醋务加。主妇人生产劳损血凝，治小儿风疾火 丹毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240626200027-jt4yxsn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240626200027-jt4yxsn"}},{"ID":"20240626200024-9zzgsss","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240626200024-9zzgsss","updated":"20240626200024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"螃蟹《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240626200024-fg61j8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626200024-fg61j8s","updated":"20240626200024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸，寒，有小毒。能解鳝鱼毒，治筋骨折伤。（带黄，去壳捣烂，微炒 之。）黄涂漆疮即愈。（蟹能化漆成水。）壳治儿枕作痛。爪破宿血，下死胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240626200024-8cwdfh1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240626200024-8cwdfh1","updated":"20240626200024"}},{"ID":"20240626200024-2cwj8x6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240626200024-2cwj8x6","updated":"20240626200024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"螃蟹《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240626200024-ljejzwo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626200024-ljejzwo","updated":"20240626200024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（龟鳖）除血热血滞化血为水"}]},{"ID":"20240626200024-ef8158z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626200024-ef8158z","updated":"20240626200024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"螃蟹（专入胃肝）。最属阴寒。故书所述利弊。大令人骇。如蟹与柿同食。则令人泄泻及发症瘕。与孕妇食。则能使胎即下。而爪尤甚。以蟹烧烟。则能集鼠于庭。（弘景曰。以黑犬血灌蟹三日烧之。诸鼠毕至。）同银朱烧烟。则能使臭虫即毙。蟹近于漆。则能化漆为水。筋骨损断。用蟹捣烂微炒。纳入疮中。则能使筋即连。他如胸中热结。 辟面肿。及蓄血发黄。妇人乳痈硬肿。小儿颅解。凡因热结热滞而成者。无不用之立效。其化血为水。逐热消瘀。未有若是其神者矣！总缘性属咸寒。外骨内肉。生青熟赤。阳包阴象。阴气纯布。故克见其迅利耳。若血因寒滞。及腹中疼痛。喜热恶寒者。其切忌焉。腌蟹宜入蒜头。则不沙蔽。中蟹毒者。宜捣藕节。热酒调服。（宗 曰。此物极动风。风疾人不可食。屡见其事。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612130628-pzo09oe","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130628-pzo09oe"}},{"ID":"20240612130629-wkgja66","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-wkgja66","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：蟹"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-c2undsw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-c2undsw","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-sa154y6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-sa154y6","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Xiè"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-08cxorx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-08cxorx","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-jm9m9c8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-jm9m9c8","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 郭索（《太玄经》），蛫（《说文》），蜅（《广雅》），蜅觜（《玉篇》），螃蟹（《蟹谱》），毛蟹、稻蟹（《医林纂要》），垪钳（《陆川本草》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-e128z2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-e128z2g","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-u46mggn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-u46mggn","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-rqv633p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-rqv633p","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-5o9jbv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-5o9jbv9","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为方蟹科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中华绒螯蟹"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肉"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"内脏"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。秋季捕捉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-17cqwix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-17cqwix","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-k4rbi25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-k4rbi25","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 沿海地区均有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-j4e0djj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-j4e0djj","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-08tl7sf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-08tl7sf","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全体被坚硬的甲壳，背面黑绿色，腹面色较浅。头胸甲长约5.4厘米，宽约6厘米，呈方圆形，背面隆起；额缘及前侧缘各有4齿。眼1对，具短柄，能活动；口器为3对颚足组成，第3对颚足扁而宽，盖在口的最外面。触角2对，位于头胸部前面中央。胸肢5对，第1对为强大的螯足，掌节和指节基部的内外面密生绒毛；其余4对为步足，长而扁平，末端尖锐呈爪状；前3对步足的腕节与前节的背缘、第4步足前节与指节基部的背缘和腹缘，都密具刚毛。腹部退化，折伏于头胸部下方，无尾节及尾肢，雌雄异形，雌的圆形，雄的三角形，俗称为脐。腹肢退化，藏在脐的内侧，雌的共4对，卵产出后，即附着于此。雄的仅2对，且已变为交配器。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-ejheh5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-ejheh5s","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"穴居于江、河、湖、泽或水田周围的土岸，昼伏夜出，以动物的尸体或谷物为食。秋季成长丰满，常洄游到近海繁殖。雌蟹所带的卵，至翌年3～5月间孵化，幼体经多次变态，发育成幼蟹，再溯江河而上，在淡水中继续生长。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-hexmwmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-hexmwmb","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本动物的甲壳（蟹壳）、爪（蟹爪）亦供药用，各详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-e8a8lim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-e8a8lim","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-yllpmde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-yllpmde","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 可食部100克含水分80克，蛋白质14克，脂肪2.6克，碳水化物0.7克，灰分2.7克；钙141毫克，磷191毫克，铁0.8毫克，维生素A230国际单位，硫胺素0.01毫克，核黄素0.51毫克，尼克酸2.1毫克；又含微量（0.05％）胆甾醇。肌肉含10余种游离氨基酸，其中谷氨酸、甘氨酸、脯氨酸、组氨酸、精氨酸量较多。蟹从海水入淡水，或从淡水入海水时，体内的氮代谢发生相应的变化。例如从海水入旗水，3小时后，肌肉中总氨基酸量即见减少。其中变化最显着的为脯氨酸与甘氨酸，同时排泄的氨量增多。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-ycrt4h4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-ycrt4h4","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-brsjpoo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-brsjpoo","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肝、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-hrfmvc2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-hrfmvc2","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经疏》：\"入足阳明、厥阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-b0uj17x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-b0uj17x","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草再新》：\"入心、肝、肾三经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-vj3m3bw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-vj3m3bw","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-8umz5qj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-8umz5qj","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-eeu268s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-eeu268s","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味咸，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-7wh4xkv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-7wh4xkv","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-lwxirko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-lwxirko","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《日华子本草》：\"凉，微毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-vpoe2sr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-vpoe2sr","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-t93jlyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-t93jlyu","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外邪未清，脾胃虚寒及宿患风疾者慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-1frmhpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-1frmhpr","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草衍义》：\"此物极动风，体有风疾人，不可食。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-fz1m42d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-fz1m42d","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《日用本草》：\"不可与红柿同食。偶中蟹毒，煎紫苏汁饮之，或捣冬瓜汁饮之，俱可解散。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-th8lg0l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-th8lg0l","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《纲目》：\"不可同柿及荆芥食，发霍乱，动风，木香汁可解。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-j4qmne3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-j4qmne3","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草经疏》：\"跌打损伤，血热瘀滞者宜之，若血因寒凝结，与夫脾胃寒滑，腹痛喜热恶寒之人，咸不宜服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-vgy1v37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-vgy1v37","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《随息居饮食谱》：\"中气虚寒，时感未清，痰嗽便泻者均忌。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-5rxfpau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-5rxfpau","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-mbp9rxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-mbp9rxj","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热，散血，续绝伤。治筋骨损伤，疥癣，漆疮，烫伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-elnybbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-elnybbm","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主胸中邪气热结痛，歪僻面肿。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-8kj0u7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-8kj0u7l","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经集注》：\"杀莨菪毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-d22odjy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-d22odjy","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《别录》：\"解结散血，愈漆疮，养筋益气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-8prggtn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-8prggtn","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④崔禹锡《食经》：\"主皶鼻恶血，明目醒酒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-ql6ijfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-ql6ijfe","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤孟诜：\"主散诸热，治胃气，理筋脉，消食。醋食之，利肢节，主五脏中烦闷气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-ndm9ikg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-ndm9ikg","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草拾遗》：\"蟹脚中髓、脚，壳中黄，并能续断绝筋骨，取碎之微熬，纳疮中筋即连也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-nwuc7jf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-nwuc7jf","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《日华子本草》：\"治产后肚痛血不下，并洒服；筋骨折伤，生捣炒罯良。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-so4ak04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-so4ak04","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《滇南本草》：\"山螃蟹强壮筋骨，并能横行络分。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-bmgqe48","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-bmgqe48","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨《纲目》：\"治疟及黄疸；捣膏涂疥疮癣疮；捣汁滴耳聋。\"\"盐蟹汁，治喉风肿痛，满含细咽即消。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-xufomym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-xufomym","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩《本经逢原》：\"生捣涂火烫。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-45z51gh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-45z51gh","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾《随息居饮食谱》：\"补骨髓，滋肝阴，充胃液，养筋活血，治疽愈核。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-bwpztm3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-bwpztm3","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-m3rlsyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-m3rlsyy","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：烧存性研末或作丸。外用：捣敷或焙干研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-6k00qoc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-6k00qoc","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-lks97ti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-lks97ti","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治骨节离脱：生蟹捣烂，以热酒倾入，连饮数碗，其渣涂之，半日内，骨内谷谷有声即好，干蟹烧灰，酒服亦好。（《唐瑶经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-kdznqd3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-kdznqd3","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治跌打骨折筋断：螃蟹，焙干研末，每次三至四钱，酒送服。（《泉州本草》合骨散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-pst4kyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-pst4kyi","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治小儿解颅：蟹螯并白及烂捣，涂颇上。（《本草衍义》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-ys0lyhe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-ys0lyhe","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治湿热黄疸：蟹烧存性研束，酒和丸如梧桐子大，每服五十丸，白汤下，日服二次。（《濒湖集简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-ptrwwg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-ptrwwg0","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治疥癣：螃蟹焙干研末，调猪脂敷患处。（《泉州本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-hr0jzu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-hr0jzu1","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治漆疮延及满身：捣烂生蟹涂之。又可敷疥疮湿癣之久不愈者。（《肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-ygs0n22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-ygs0n22","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治妇人产后儿枕疼：山螃蟹不拘多少，用新瓦焙干，热烧酒服，良效。（《滇南本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-jax1vj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-jax1vj8","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-asksw2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-asksw2n","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草经疏》：\"蟹味咸气寒，入足阳明，足厥阴经。经曰：’热淫于内，治以咸寒’，故主胸中热结痛也。歪僻者，厥阴风热也，面肿者，阳明热壅也，解二经之热，则筋得养而气自益，歪僻面肿俱除矣。咸走血而软坚，故能解结散血。愈漆疮者，以其能解漆毒故也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-tjp6fe9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-tjp6fe9","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本经逢原》：\"蟹性专破血，故能续断绝筋骨。《本经》主胸中邪气热结痛，歪僻面肿，皆是瘀血为患。性能败漆，今人生捣治漆疮、涂火伤，皆取散血之意。《日华》治筋骨折伤，生捣盫之。藏器云能续断筋，去壳用黄，捣烂微炒，纳入疮中，筋即连也。可知其功不独散而能和血矣。惟蟹与柿性寒，所以二物不宜同食，令人泄泻发癥瘕。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-kpjejq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-kpjejq0","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-qra6k4i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-qra6k4i","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-2q6tgtt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-2q6tgtt","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：蟹"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-ay54aco","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-ay54aco","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-7vtjucg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-7vtjucg","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Xiè"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-ccs5k0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-ccs5k0c","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-hv6asnv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-hv6asnv","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 郭索、无肠公子、螃蟹、横行介士、毛蟹、稻蟹、方海、胜蓄芳蟹、河蟹、淡水蟹、毛夹子、大闸蟹、方蟹"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-yvuxott","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-yvuxott","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-r2e47km","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-r2e47km","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Crab"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-vj5t0o5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-vj5t0o5","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-66uhm34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-66uhm34","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-foz9fiq","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-foz9fiq","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240612130629-uxl3vo7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-uxl3vo7","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240612130629-jxgcfzl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-jxgcfzl","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶弘景：蟹类甚多，蝤蚶、拥剑、彭螖皆是，并不入药，惟蟹最多有用。未被霜，甚有毒，云食水茛所为，人中之，不即疗多死。服冬瓜汁、紫苏汁及大黄丸皆得瘥。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-ucxgnpj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-ucxgnpj","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：蟹，横行甲虫也。雄者脐长，雌者脐团，生于流水者色黄而腥，生于止水者色纠而馨。凡蟹生烹、盐藏、糟收、酒浸、酱汁浸皆为佳品，但久留易沙，见灯亦沙，得椒易脑，得皂荚或蒜及韶粉可兔沙、瞋，得自英则黄不散，得"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-elg7b38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-elg7b38","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-bym5ikm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-bym5ikm","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为方蟹科动物中华绒螯蟹和日本绒螯蟹的肉和内脏。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-6r9zdji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-6r9zdji","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Eriocheir sinensis H.Milne-Ed-wards2.Eriocheir japonicus(de Haan)"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-984cvio","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-984cvio","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：多在立冬前后采捕，捕法可用竹簖或网具等。捕后洗净烫死，晒干或鲜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-znpnbc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-znpnbc8","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-ebn6gi2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-ebn6gi2","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境： 1.秋季常回游到近海繁殖，雌蟹所抱的卵，至惊翌年3-5月间孵化，经多次变态，发育成幼蟹，再溯江河而上，在淡水中成长。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-stwiids","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-stwiids","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.生活于河流中，以河口半咸底层较多。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-xr4zwca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-xr4zwca","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.我国沿海各地均有他布。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-3brjmc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-3brjmc4","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.他布于福建、台湾、广东等沿海。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-nuv4koc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-nuv4koc","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-o3gikau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-o3gikau","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.中华绒螯蟹，头胸甲呈圆文武有，后半部宽于前半。一般长约55mm，宽61mm左右，个别可宽80-90mm。背面隆起，额及肝区凹陷，胃区前面具6个对称的颗粒状突起，胃区与心区分界显着，前者周围有凹点。额宽，分4齿，眼窝上缘近中部处突出，略呈三角形、眼1对，具短柄，能活动。前侧缘具4锐齿，末齿最小而引入一隆线，斜行于鳃区外侧，沿后侧缘内方亦具一隆线。雄体螯足粗壮，比雌体的为大，掌与指节基部内外面密生绒毛，腕节内末端具1锐刺，长节背缘末端附近及步足的长节同样均具1锐刺。步足以最后3对较为扁平，腕七与前节的背缘各具刚毛，第4步足前节与指节基部的背缘与腹缘皆密具铡毛。雌体腹部近圆形，雄体略呈三角形，末端狭尖。背面青褐绿色，腹面色淡或灰白色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-qre6hr9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-qre6hr9","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.日本绒螯蟹，形态、大小与中华绒蟹颇为近似，额分4齿，居中的两齿较钝圆，两侧的较尖锐，额后部的突起不若前种那样锋锐。前侧缘另亦4齿，但末齿甚小，几乎仅留痕迹。螯足掌节有厚密的绒毛，并扩展至腕节末端及两指的基部，而指内缘的齿较钝。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-vwwe3rp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-vwwe3rp","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-q5ic5k8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-q5ic5k8","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生活习性，营水自由生活，鳃呼吸。雌雄异体，行有性生殖，个体发育过程中分为受精卵（胚胎）一幼体一成蟹三个变态时期，形态各异。1年后性成熟。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-c9gd3r4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-c9gd3r4","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"河蟹多居住于江、河、湖泊周围的泥草或河滩的洞穴里。在洞穴中越冬。为浅海里生、淡水中长的回游性水生动物，在淡水中生长发育，到性成熟时即沿江河到河口区浅海中进行交配、受精和产卵。并孵化出蟹苗，称为“生殖回游”，蟹苗（幼体）溯江、河而上，回游到淡水各种水体内，摄取食物，并生长发育到性成熟，是为“索食回游”。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-6dwrucj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-6dwrucj","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"养殖技术，当河口区水温升高到10℃左右进，河蟹即开始交配，产出受精卵，产出的卵粘附在雌蟹的附肢上，一般在10万粒左右，多者可达数十万粒。受精卵在河口区孵化蟹苗。目前，各国都从捞苗开始人工养蟹，而孵化期是自然界里完成。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-cotrm4h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-cotrm4h","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饲养管理，养蟹池应选择环境安静、水源充足、土质较硬的地方，面积0.067-0.033hm2，坡度1：（3-4），深100-150cm，池中用砖石垒成50cm高的小岛，内有蟹窝，窝内放入泥土，岛上种植水省事植物。利用自然沟塘、稻田也可以养蟹。四周要设防逃设备。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-svol78u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-svol78u","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蟹苗捕捞后，近距离可用水桶、水箱湿运，远距离可用蟹苗箱干运，或用尼龙袋充氧运输。蟹苗入池放养前应先施肥肥塘，再注入新水，一般在6月初至中旬进行。如果池浮游生物不够，可投入适量捣碎的熟卵黄，待大眼幼苗蜕掉最后一次壳变为幼蟹后，即可喂小杂鱼、糠虾与豆饼、花生并绞碎泼酒入池饲喂。注意养成蟹时以池水浅，溶氧充沛为宜以植物饵料为食，在池边投料。夏天可适当加深水位。注意防止天敌侵入和成蟹逃逸。冬季蟹有在洞内冬眠习性，也有在池塘泥底冬眠者，北方应加深水位，保证在冰层以下有1m水深为宜，以防冬季水干死蟹。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-ykfnxml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-ykfnxml","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-hsg4iga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-hsg4iga","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别（1）哗 绒螯蟹，头胸甲圆方形，后半部宽于前半部，额宽分4齿，前侧缘有4锐齿。螯足雄性较雌性大，掌节与指节基部的内外侧密生绒毛，步足最后3对较为扁平，腕节与前节有刚毛。腹部雌圆雄尖，表面橘红色或土黄褐色。肢多脱落，壳硬脆，体软，气腥，味咸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-d475dsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-d475dsh","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）日本绒螯蟹，头胸甲前窄后宽，额宽约当头胸甲最宽处的1/3，前缘分4齿，中间2齿钝圆，两侧齿尖锐，额后突起不及中华绒螯蟹锋锐。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-jtmtjyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-jtmtjyh","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别，粉末特征：中华绒螯蟹，黄棕色。①棒状碎片淡黄色，胞腔明显，壁薄，侧壁微呈梯形，其上有细小分枝；有的一端较粗，另一端渐细至尖。②不规则状物淡黄色或黑棕色，有形外侧壁光滑，内侧有密网纹。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-yjzmvrm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-yjzmvrm","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-t8m0jcy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-t8m0jcy","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 中华绒螯蟹可食部100g含水分80g，蛋白质14g，脂肪2.6g，碳水化合物0.7g，灰分2.7g；钙141mg，磷191mg，铁0.8mg，维生素（vitamin）A230u ，硫胺素（thiamine）0.01，核黄素（riboflavine）0.51mg，烟酸（nicotinic acid）2.1mg；微量（0.05%）胆甾醇（cholesterol）。还含三磷酸腺苷酶（ATPase），α皮黄质（α-doradexanthin），叶黄素（lutein），虾黄质（astaxanthin）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-blyeq4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-blyeq4j","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肌肉含10余种游离氨基酸，基中谷氨酸（glutamic acid），甘氨酸（glycine），脯氨酸（proline），组氨酸（histidine），精氨酸（arginine）量较多。含酰基酶A脱氢酶（acyl-CoA dehydrogenase），磷脂（phospholipid），三酰甘油（triglyceride）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-pfn39xf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-pfn39xf","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前鳃及后鳃含环磷酸腺苷依赖性蛋白激酶（Camp-dependent protein kinase）。后鳃含-5-羟色胺（serotonin）和多巴胺（dopamine）的受体，蛋白激酶（protein kinase）C。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-aj85qo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-aj85qo7","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前鳃、线粒体部分、微粒体部分含Na=K-三磷酸腺苷酶。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-quepfhd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-quepfhd","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血淋巴含去甲肾上腺素（noradrenaline），多巴（dopa）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-xr8wbwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-xr8wbwm","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日本螯蟹肉及血中含蛋白质、脂肪、糖类、无机物等。蛋白质经酸水解后得天冬氨酸（aspartic acid），谷氨酸，胱氨酸（cystine），甘氨酸，组氨酸，亮氨酸（leucine），赖氨酸（lysine），蛋氨酸（methionine），苯丙氨酸（phenylalanine），脯氨酸，丝氨酸（serine），牛磺酸（taurine），色氨酸（tryptophan），酷氨酸（tyrosine），缬氨酸（valine），丙氨酸（ alanine），精氨酸等。脂类有磷脂（phospholipid），胆甾醇（cholesterol），三酰甘油。粮尖有海藻糖（mycose），乳糖（lactose），麦芽糖（maltose），半乳糖（galactose），葡萄糖（glucose），果糖（fructose），岩藻糖（fucose），氨基糖（aminosugar），低聚糖（oligose），葡萄糖及果糖的6-磷酸酯（6-phosphate）。尚含有维生素（vitamin）A，硫胺素，核黄素，烟酸。非挥发性酸有枸橼酸（citric acid），延胡索酸（fumaric acid），α酮戊二酸（α-ketoglutaric acid），乳酸（lactic acid）；苹果酸（malic acid），丙酮酸（pyruvic acid），琥珀酸（succinic acid）；挥发性酸有甲酸（formic acid），乙酸（acetic acid），丙酸（propionic acid），丁酸（butyric acid）等。此外，还含β-羟基酰基畏酶A脱氢酶（β-hydroxyacyl-CoA dehydrogenase）,β-乙酰畏酶A硫解酶（β-actoacetyl-CoA thiolase），去饱和酶（desaturase）等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-8u486h8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-8u486h8","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳃含Na-K-ATP酶和甘油磷酰胆碱（glyceryl phosphoryl choline）的缩醛（acetal）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-os49p4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-os49p4v","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中食管腺含胆甾醇（cholesterol），菜幅甾醇（campesterol），β谷甾醇（β-sitosterol）等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-fe0xn5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-fe0xn5t","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉球近方蟹全体含总脂肪酸，Δ5，8，11，14，17-二十碳五烯酸 （Δ5，8，11，14，17-eicosapentaenoic acid），二十二碳六烯酸（docosahexaenoic acid）及花生酸（arachidonic acid）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-wlasjgb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-wlasjgb","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肌肉组织含磷脂酰胆碱（phosphatidylcholine）及磷脂酰乙醇胺（Phosphatidyl ethanolamine），其脂肪酸组成多为不饱和脂肪酸。神经系统含磷脂（phospholipids），包括磷脂酰乙醇胺、磷脂酰丝氨酸（phosphatdylserine），其组成脂肪酸有饱和及单烯酸（C16：0，C18：0，C18：1，C20：1）。此外，还有二十碳五烯酸、二十二碳六烯酸。眼含类胡萝卜素（carotenoids），包括虾黄质（astaxanthin），含视紫红质（rhodopsin）。鳃（gill）含Na-K-ATP酶。ΔΔ"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-cuz702c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-cuz702c","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-vscr3av","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-vscr3av","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 理化鉴别，取本吕粉末2g于试管中加胶塞。[胶塞中间插入一弯管，另一端插入盛有Ca(OH)2溶液试管内]再加入盐酸，立即塞紧则不断产生气泡，同时Ca（OH）2溶液变成白色浑浊，放置则有白色沉淀。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-gyojoi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-gyojoi5","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-stu6ona","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-stu6ona","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝；胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-kpcqyc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-kpcqyc7","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-i7l6pgm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-i7l6pgm","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味咸；性寒"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-haxhpoo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-haxhpoo","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-p3fng4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-p3fng4l","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外邪未清，脾胃虚寒及宿患风痰者慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-g004xqn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-g004xqn","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草衍义》：此物极动风，体有风痰人，不可食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-6kb8tnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-6kb8tnd","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《日用本草》：不可与红柿同食。偶中蟹毒，煎紫苏汁饮之，或捣冬瓜汁钦之，俱可解散。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-qfzfecv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-qfzfecv","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《纲目》：不可同柿及荆芥食，发霍乱动风，木香汁可解。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-tm9xs7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-tm9xs7w","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草经疏》：跌打损伤，血热瘀滞者宜之，若血因寒凝结，与夫脾胃寒滑，腹痛喜热恶宠之人，咸不宜服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-869nszy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-869nszy","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《随息居饮食谱》：中气虚寒，时感末清，痰嗽便泻者均忌。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-mjq9uos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-mjq9uos","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-7g6zmpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-7g6zmpm","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热；散瘀；消肿解毒。主湿热黄疸；产后瘀滞腹痛；筋骨损伤，痈肿疔毒；漆毒"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-i9cst9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-i9cst9o","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-1si0xok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-1si0xok","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：烧存性研末，或入丸剂，5-10g。外用：适量，鲜口捣敷；或绞汁滴耳；焙干研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-zxf3sai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-zxf3sai","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-nrf3855","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-nrf3855","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治骨节离脱：生蟹捣烂，以热酒顾入，连放数碗，其渣涂之，半日内，骨内谷谷有声即好，干蟹烧灰，酒服亦好。(《唐瑶经验方》)②治跌打骨折筋断：螃蟹，焙干研末，每次三至四钱，酒送服。(《泉州本草》合骨散)③治小儿解颅：蟹螯并白及烂捣，涂囱上。(《本草衍义》)④治湿热黄疸：蟹烧存性研末，酒和丸如梧桐子大，每服五十丸，白汤下，日服二次。(《濒湖集简方》)⑤治疥癣：螃蟹焙干研末，调猪脂敷患处。(《泉州本草》)⑥治漆疮延及满身：捣烂生蟹涂之。又可敷疥疮湿癣之久不愈者。(《肘后方》)⑦治妇人产后儿枕疼：山螃蟹不拘多少，用新瓦焙干，热烧酒服，良效。(《滇南本草》)"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-nspcihj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-nspcihj","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-oxqjoko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-oxqjoko","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：主胸中邪气热结痛，歪僻面肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-idkh05l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-idkh05l","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经集注》：杀莨菪毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-cq7182w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-cq7182w","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《别录》：解结散血，愈漆疮，养筋益气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-mbzr2pm","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-mbzr2pm","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240612130629-51vw8ua","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-51vw8ua","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240612130629-4hkibp5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-4hkibp5","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"崔禹锡《食经》：主查鼻恶血，明目醒酒。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-k2t9gpk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-k2t9gpk","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240612130629-nmtsva5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-nmtsva5","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孟诜：主散诸热，治胃气，理筋脉，消食。醋食之，利胶节，主五脏中烦闷气。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-jfec0u4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-jfec0u4","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草拾遗》：蟹脚中髓、脑．壳中黄，并能续断绝筋骨，取碎之微熬，纳疮中筋即连也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-zz56caa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-zz56caa","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《日华子本草》：治产后肚痛血不下，并酒服；筋骨折伤，生捣炒署良。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-fbxrjnw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-fbxrjnw","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《滇南本草》：山螃蟹强壮筋骨，并能横行络分。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-jf3f1o9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-jf3f1o9","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《纲目》：治疟及黄疸；捣膏涂疥疮癣疮；捣汁滴耳聋。盐蟹汁，治喉风肿痛，湖含细咽即消。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-90byyv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-90byyv3","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《本经逢原》：生捣涂火烫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-e937idd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-e937idd","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《随息居饮食谱》：补骨髓，滋肝阴，充胃液，养筋活血，治疽愈核。"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-adyuydp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-adyuydp","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612130629-w62wzwx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130629-w62wzwx","updated":"20240612130629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612130631-87885kz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612130631-87885kz"}},{"ID":"20240612130632-87gwi86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612130632-87gwi86"}}]}